    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Malisons have serpentine features that make them deadly fighters. This kind is human from the waist up, with the coiling body of a giant snake below. Malisons carry a lethal venom, which some of them shape into magical attacks, and they can turn into snakes to slip into position for an ambush or to slither away without a trace.</p>",
